        <section class="about-seneca mb-[40px] sm:mb-[78px]">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row">
                    <div class="w-full xs:mx-auto sm:w-6/12 order-1 sm:order-2">
                        <div class="pt-8 pb-4 sm:px-6 md:pl-[70px] lg:pl-[100px] md:pr-[70px] content no-overflow flex flex-col justify-center h-full">
                            <h2>Who We Are</h2>
<p>Seneca Impact Advisors is a purpose-driven firm at the intersection of finance and nature, combining financial expertise with an NGO-level focus on impact. We bring deep experience in nature finance, capital mobilisation, blended finance, and advisory expertise to support partners tackling biodiversity, climate, and sustainable development challenges.</p>
<p>We are collaborative by design. We work with public and private actors, primarily in Asia-Pacific and increasingly in Africa, to turn bold ideas into investable solutions.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
                            
                            
                            <ul class="list-none mt-[20px] content-menu">
                                <li>
                                    <a href="https://senecaimpact.earth/about-us/" class="cta with-arrow green">Learn more</a>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-full xs:mx-auto sm:w-6/12 order-2 sm:order-1">
                                                    <div class="img-wrap">
                                <img src="https://senecaimpact.earth/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/shutterstock_2125921319-square-1024x1024.jpg" srcset="https://senecaimpact.earth/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/shutterstock_2125921319-square-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://senecaimpact.earth/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/shutterstock_2125921319-square-300x300.jpg 300w, https://senecaimpact.earth/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/shutterstock_2125921319-square-150x150.jpg 150w, https://senecaimpact.earth/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/shutterstock_2125921319-square-768x768.jpg 768w, https://senecaimpact.earth/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/shutterstock_2125921319-square-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://senecaimpact.earth/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/shutterstock_2125921319-square-2048x2048.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, (max-width: 1919px) 45vw, 865px " class="object-cover" alt="">
                            </div>
                                            </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row">
                    <div class="w-full xs:mx-auto sm:w-6/12 order-1">
                        <div class="pt-8 pb-4 sm:px-6 md:pr-[70px] lg:pr-[100px] md:pl-[70px] content no-overflow flex flex-col justify-center h-full">
                            <h2>What We Do</h2>
<p>Seneca helps partners develop and scale commercially viable, high-impact projects and advance broader nature-related goals with measurable outcomes for ecosystems and communities.</p>
<p>We advise governments, NGOs, corporates, and bilateral and multilateral institutions, aligning stakeholders, shaping strategies, and supporting the development of bankable projects through joint development, strategic support, and long-term collaboration.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>

                            
                            <ul class="list-none mt-[20px] content-menu">
                                <li>
